    "description": "<p>These are the raw data files associated with the publication \"Dual-functionality of NiSe2-CoSe2 nanowires for electrochemical charge storage and efficient thermal energy conversion\" (<a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15230201\">Dual-functionality of NiSe2-CoSe2 nanowires for electrochemical charge storage and efficient thermal energy conversion</a>).</p>",
